               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_N202D3">In stiff black binding with "Minde-Cantater." printed in gold in the middle of the front cover. In upper left-hand corner a handwritten label inscribed: "Minde - Cantater / Fru Anna Nielsen. / Hofmarschal v. Levetzau / Professor N.P. Nielsen" in Emil Erslev's hand. The three scores are separated from each other by pink folios. On the verso of the fly-leaf Gade has written: "SørgeKantate / over / Overhofmarschall v. Levetzau / af / H.P. Holst / og / Niels W Gade / (opført i Frue Kirke, / November 1859.)" Later added in pencil in lower right-hand corner: "(componeret / paa een Nat og een Dag (1876). Written in ink. Paper: 18. Paginated 1-24. Heading in upper right-hand corner of p. 1: "Sørgekantate over Levetzau". At the end of the music dated "November 1859"  and Gade's musical signature.</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
